OL,3,GNEWSAGlastonbury 2027 tickets sell out
OL,4,Ain 42 minutes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTickets for Glastonbury Festival 2027
OL,7,Fhave sold out in 42 minutes, organisers
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FThousands of people joined the online
OL,11,Fqueue at 09:00 BST in the hope of
OL,12,Fsecuring tickets to the festival at
OL,13,FWorthy Farm in Somerset which returns
OL,14,Ffrom 23 to 27 June after a fallow year.
OL,16,FOrganisers confirmed last month that
OL,17,Ftickets for the weekend were at their
OL,18,Fhighest price ever - #408, including a
OL,19,F#5 booking fee per ticket - an increase
OL,20,Fof #29.50 from the last festival in
OL,21,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
