OL,3,GNEWSAGlastonbury 2027 tickets sell out
OL,4,Ain 42 minutes
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeadliners for the festival have yet to
OL,7,Fbe announced but organiser Emily Eavis
OL,8,Fpreviously said the team was "very
OL,9,Fexcited" and the festival was "coming
OL,10,Ftogether really well".
